{"id":"n89809-10-8","stage":2,"title":"끊어지다 · 被挂断","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89809-10-8-1","ko":"전화가 끊어져서 죄송합니다.","zh":"电话断了，很抱歉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전화가","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：电话；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화가","audio":"/audio/ec4fb69ab983651b2225.mp3"}},{"text":"끊어져서","meaning":"被挂断，被切断","explanation":"끊어지다：被挂断，被切断；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"끊어지다","audio":"/audio/604575a92730ac00bf4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89809","senseId":"10","lemma":"끊어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끊어져서","audio":"/audio/b07ff27e97a6ce717254.mp3"}},{"text":"죄송합니다.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송합니다","audio":"/audio/46ce53f2332052b62c9f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6db518d738ede991","term":"전화","zh":"电话","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3","entryId":"20260","definition":"把说话声变成电波或电流发送出去，使相隔很远的人也可以互相对话的机器。","pronunciation":["전ː화"]},{"id":"604575a92730ac00","term":"끊어지다","zh":"被挂断，被切断","audio":"/audio/604575a92730ac00bf4b.mp3","entryId":"89809","definition":"用电话或互联网进行的语言交流及思想沟通被中断。","pronunciation":["끄너지다"]},{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e2aba3d7960d8644fd31.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89809-10-8-2","ko":"아니에요. 아까 하시던 말씀이 뭐였죠?","zh":"没事的。您刚才在说什么来着？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니에요.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚。","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"하시던","meaning":"表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"하다：表示说这样那样的话；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하시던","audio":"/audio/d4b1f59ee4db07b69c4e.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀이","meaning":"话","explanation":"말씀：话；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀이","audio":"/audio/e93201e62e69c17541cd.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐였죠?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐였죠","audio":"/audio/4961946657308fceb1fb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示说这样那样的话。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示说这样那样的话。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(敬语)别人的言语。","pronunciation":["